    "notes": "A mild forest with orange grass and leaves, birch-trunked amber trees and extra copper. features holds one list of placed features per decoration step, in the game's step order; msm_starter:amber_tree_placed is in the vegetal decoration step and msm_starter:rich_copper_ore_placed in the underground ores step. The vanilla features are kept in vanilla's order, which avoids the \"Feature order cycle\" crash. The biome appears in worlds made with the World Type of msm_starter:amber_world."
